        >
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <span class="inline-block w-7 h-[1px] bg-[#D6B66C]"></span>
              <span class="text-[10.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.26em] text-[#D6B66C] font-semibold">
                Dining · Bar · Reception
              </span>
            </div>

            <h2 class="font-cormorant text-3xl xl:text-[2.4rem] leading-[1.1] text-[#F5F1E8] mb-3">
              Candlelight, Spirits
              <span class="block text-[#F3E7C4] italic font-normal">&amp; Island Hospitality</span>
            </h2>

            <p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#C8BFAE] max-w-sm">
              Experience <strong class="text-[#F3E7C4] font-medium">Kramuka Restaurant</strong> (50–80 Pax) &amp; <strong class="text-[#F3E7C4] font-medium">Zriya Banquet Hall</strong> (1150 Sq. Ft.) in Havelock, and Egyptian-themed <strong class="text-[#F3E7C4] font-medium">Cleopatra Restaurant</strong> (30–50 Pax) &amp; <strong class="text-[#F3E7C4] font-medium">Anubis Rooftop Lounge Bar</strong> in Port Blair.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-3 pt-4 border-t border-white/10">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 text-left">
              <div class="rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 px-3 py-2">
                <p class="text-[9.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#D6B66C]">Havelock Resort</p>
                <p class="text-xs font-medium text-[#F5F1E8] mt-0.5">Kramuka (50–80 Pax) &amp; Zriya Hall</p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 px-3 py-2">
                <p class="text-[9.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#D6B66C]">Port Blair Hotel</p>
                <p class="text-xs font-medium text-[#F5F1E8] mt-0.5">Cleopatra (30–50 Pax) &amp; Anubis Bar</p>
